{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はネプリーグの収録に行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解答席はまいやん、れなりん、生駒ちゃんとさゆりんと私の５人♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも番組見てるので、セットに感動しっぱなしでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネプチューンさんやゲストの方々、おもしろくてとっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月20日放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てくださいo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日8/6には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HEY!HEY!HEY!に出演させていただいてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしのソングもいっぱい聞けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルの先輩方ってすごいな〜って感じました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、走れ！bicycleも歌っているのでぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日8/8にはFNS歌謡祭に出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送！緊張するけど頑張ります(o｀・∀・´o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん見てください〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、個人PVのショート版が見れるようになってますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のテーマは「ぶらり旅」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は広島県の尾道に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に「西の方に旅行ってきます」って言ったのはこのことです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尾道は色々な映画が撮影された場所"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"町並みや自然がきれいな事に感動したり、歴史を感じて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても充実した楽しいぶらり旅でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のはtype-Cに収録されています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてもらえたらうれしいです(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「写って〜」って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなちょっとしか入ってくれなかったぁ(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰の一部か分かりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人いるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/06/8241083/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}